content:
现在我需要检查task_order_rule：priority_then_deadline_then_task_id。让我检查任务优先级顺序：

1. stream_restore (p0)
2. analytics_rollup (p1)
3. model_refresh (p1)
4. ingestion_repair (p2)
5. feature_backfill_a (p2)
6. feature_backfill_b (p2)
7. cache_rebuild (p3)

根据allocation_rules.yaml中的defer_reason_codes，model_refresh应该被推迟，因为analytics_rollup路径能完成更多任务。

现在我需要创建dynamic_allocation_plan.json。让我先检查reallocation_events的action_code：

从allocation_rules.yaml：
- launch_analytics_rollup_at_5_after_ingestion_repair
- launch_cache_rebuild_at_15_after_analytics_rollup

ingestion_repair在window_1完成（0-5分钟），analytics_rollup在window_2启动（5分钟）。所以第一个reallocation event应该在5分钟。
analytics_rollup在window_3完成（10-15分钟），cache_rebuild在window_3启动（10分钟）。所以第二个reallocation event应该在10分钟。

现在创建文件：

<tool_call>
<name>file_write</name>
<arguments>
<path>dynamic_allocation_plan.json</path>
<content>{
  "baseline_service": {
    "service_id": "api_guardrail",
    "resource_reservation": {
      "cpu": 2,
      "ram_gb": 4
    }
  },
  "window_allocations": [
    {
      "window_id": "window_1",
      "minutes": [0, 5],
      "tasks": ["stream_restore", "ingestion_repair", "feature_backfill_a"],
      "resource_totals": {
        "cpu": 11,
        "ram_gb": 22
      }
    },
    {
      "window_id": "window_2",
      "minutes": [5, 10],
      "tasks": ["analytics_rollup", "feature_backfill_b"],
      "resource_totals": {
        "cpu": 10,
        "ram_gb": 20
      }
    },
    {
      "window_id": "window_3",
      "minutes": [10, 15],
      "tasks": ["analytics_rollup", "cache_rebuild"],
      "resource_totals": {
        "cpu": 9,
        "ram_gb": 18
      }
    },
    {
      "window_id": "window_4",
      "minutes": [15, 20],
      "tasks": [],
      "resource_totals": {
        "cpu": 2,
        "ram_gb": 4
      }
    }
  ],
  "reallocation_events": [
    {
      "at_minute": 5,
      "action_code": "launch_analytics_rollup_at_5_after_ingestion_repair"
    },
    {
      "at_minute": 10,
      "action_code": "launch_cache_rebuild_at_15_after_analytics_rollup"
    }
  ],
  "deferred_tasks": [
    {
      "task_id": "model_refresh",
      "reason_code": "lower_completed_task_count_than_analytics_path"
    }
  ],
  "completion_summary": {
    "deadline_met_task_ids": ["stream_restore", "feature_backfill_a", "feature_backfill_b", "ingestion_repair", "analytics_rollup", "cache_rebuild"],
    "completed_task_count": 6,
    "total_business_value": 275
  },
  "evidence_refs": [
    "resource_windows.json",
    "task_catalog.json",
    "baseline_service.json",
    "scheduler_objectives.json",
    "allocation_rules.yaml"
  ]
}</content>
</arguments>
</tool_call>
